<title>USA: Tenneco unit says acquires Turkish venture.</title>
<headline>Tenneco unit says acquires Turkish venture.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tenneco Automotive unit of Tenneco Inc said it acquired Borusan Amortisor, Tenneco's shock absorber joint venture in Turkey.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Tenneco is a diversified manufacturing company based in Greenwich, Connecticut. Its shares were off 1 at 50.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
